WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:22.952
The page starts from what she already wrote

2
00:00:22.952 --> 00:00:44.433
A design that looks like a person, not a form

3
00:00:44.433 --> 00:01:03.004
Everything she wrote is already on the page

4
00:01:03.004 --> 00:01:22.006
One link, and no account to open it

5
00:01:22.006 --> 00:01:40.363
A neighbour writes to her, with no account

6
00:01:40.363 --> 00:02:11.960
Nothing reaches her page until she accepts it
